Chapter: Arm64StackHeap
  cites Foreword chapter Console

Section: Collision

 The heap is advanced a gigabyte, past the boot stack at #80000000, so the
 next non-leaf prologue finds SP below x28.

  depth : Integer -> Integer
  depth (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else 1 + depth (n - 1)

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("before: " & show (depth 3))
    let moved = __heap-advance 1073741824
    in print-line-uni ("after: " & show (depth 3))
  end

